;Suspend transaction
Alias ScanField 90 674
Alias trans 189 753
Alias dialog 506 366

Assert color 90 15 #000080 ;ensures someone is logged in

MouseClick ScanField 
TypeText 9414982020900 ;kenya bold
PressKey Enter
Sleep 5000

MouseClick trans
Sleep 1000

ClickButton "Select an option" "Suspend transaction"
MouseClick 451 394 ;Optional reason/customer reference
TypeText "Testing"
ClickButton "Enter data" "OK"
Sleep 500

Assert memo dialog "Please ask customer to sign the duplicate receipt"
;MouseClick 482 476 ;please ask cust to sign receipt
ClickButton FormDlg Ok
Sleep 500; give time to do its thing, ready for next sale
